          "note": "实验性，按当前桌面版本逐项适配。支持消息与队列、审批、即时与异步答题。符合条件时支持运行中作答、异步单题跳过与恢复，并可在 Windows 尝试关闭关联的桌面卡。详情见移动端远程手册。",
          "noteEn": "Experimental and verified per operation for the current desktop build. Includes messages and queues, approvals, blocking questions, and async answers. Eligible sessions can answer while running, skip and restore single-question groups, and attempt to close the paired desktop card on Windows. See the mobile remote manual for details."
        },
        {
          "name": "ZCode 会话远程控制（官方桥接）",
          "nameEn": "ZCode remote control (official bridge)",
          "key": "zcode_official_control",
          "support": {
            "claude": "no",
            "codex": "no",
            "opencode": "no",
            "kimi": "no",
            "workbuddy": "no",
            "zcode": "yes",
            "dsh": "no",
            "openclaw": "no"
          },
          "note": "**0.6.5 重磅：ZCode 全面功能接入**。ZCode 桌面端经官方桥接（单条 relay，BigModel OAuth）把 workspace / 会话投影到看板，手机端可：发送消息（含运行中排队）、应答阻塞问答（单选/多选/自由文本）、批准命令与文件、计划审批（批准或反馈修改意见）、定向打断、切换供应商/模型/思维档位（显式确认修改）、切换协作模式（计划/自动编辑/变更前确认/完全访问）、本地待发队列（入队/插队/再编辑/撤回/继续）。控制走动作账本 + actionId 幂等，按宿主 build 证据逐项开闸（能力 key 随 build/协议变化自动失效重算），账号 JWT 只在系统凭据保险箱与受控内存。**Windows 实机验证**（3.17.2.9661：发送/问答/打断/模型档位/协作模式全通过，队列在 Windows 3.17.2 亦有实机链路）；ZAI 通道仅源码与模拟证据，暂不开放授权。",
          "noteEn": "**0.6.5 flagship: ZCode full feature integration**. The ZCode desktop app projects its workspace and sessions onto the board over the official bridge (single relay, BigModel OAuth); from the phone you can send messages (queued while a turn runs), answer blocking Q&A (single/multi-select, free text), approve commands and files, review plans (approve or send change feedback), interrupt a running turn, switch provider/model/thinking level (explicit apply), switch collaboration modes (Plan / Auto edit / Confirm-before-changes / Full access), and manage the local outbox (enqueue, prioritise, edit, retract, resume). Control runs on an action ledger with idempotent actionIds, gated per host build evidence (capability keys auto-invalidate on build/protocol changes), and the account JWT lives only in the system credential vault and controlled memory. **Verified on Windows** (3.17.2.9661: send / Q&A / interrupt / model & level / collaboration mode all pass; the outbox is also exercised against Windows 3.17.2). The ZAI channel has source-and-simulation evidence only; authorisation stays closed for now."
        },
